post.summary:
`POST /api/v1/agent-packages/preview`: what the package folder contains,
its agents, its triggers and its Python dependencies. Nothing is written;
a manifest that breaks an invariant answers a preview marked invalid.

get.summary:
`GET /api/v1/connectors/imap/providers`: the providers whose server and
port are filled from the address. Reads a table compiled into the runtime;
nothing is reached, nothing is stored.

maxLoaded.description:
The explicit ceiling on resident models (`APOLLIA_LLAMA_MAX_LOADED`);
`null` when the load guardrail alone decides how many stay loaded, and
without an engine.

UpdateChannelRequest.description:
Request body for `PUT /api/v1/notifications/channels/:id`.

The `label` field uses a double `Option`:
- absent from JSON: `None`, keep the existing label;
- `null`: `Some(None)`, clear the label;
- `"text"`: `Some(Some("text"))`, replace it.
